# Canonical author identities.
#
# `gh pr merge --squash` authors the squash commit with the GitHub *profile*
# display name, so one commit here is attributed to "Yuu". Map it back so
# `git shortlog`, the contributors graph and `%aN` all agree with the local
# identity. Anything not listed surfaces in the author guard.
